# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3D Model Backups
# Only character3.glb is used by the website model-viewer.
# character.glb and character2.glb are unused 56 MB iterations.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
assets/models/character.glb
assets/models/character2.glb

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unused Photography RAW Originals
# Web-optimised WebP and JPG images in assets/photography/
# are used on the live site. These originals are unreferenced
# 5–12 MB high-res camera exports.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
assets/photography/originals/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unreferenced Raw Model Textures
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
assets/textures/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw / Uncompressed Video Formats
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.mov
*.MOV
*.avi
*.AVI

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vercel & Build Artefacts
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vercel
.next/
out/
